{"title":"2008 Mock ARML 2 Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_2_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Equilateral_triangle\" title=\"Equilateral triangle\">Equilateral triangle</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> has a side length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. A ball begins at vertex <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, rolls through the interior of the triangle, bounces off side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />, and settles at point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. Given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/8/e9889a965bcf2784d3ddd9c20ffcbb5f6dcf2c30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BP = 3$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/1/dc178c61ad2519252f003657560830518121df2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CP = 5$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" />, find the total distance that the ball travels. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_2_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/c/7ec253fd364dd1225be09c338424ccbcbbcf3281.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pointpen = black; pathpen = black + linewidth(0.7); pair A=(0,0),B=(7,0),C=7*expi(pi/3);  pair Q=IP(CR(B,3),CR(C,5)), P=OP(CR(B,3),CR(C,5)),D=IP(A--Q,B--C); D(MP(&quot;A&quot;,A)--MP(&quot;B&quot;,B)--MP(&quot;C&quot;,C,N)--cycle); D(A--D--D(MP(&quot;P&quot;,P)));D(D--D(MP(&quot;P&#39;&quot;,Q,NE))--C--Q--B,linetype(&quot;5 5&quot;)); MP(&quot;7&quot;,(A+B)/2); MP(&quot;3&quot;,(B+Q)/2,SE); MP(&quot;5&quot;,(C+Q)/2,NE);  [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"218\" /></center>\n<p>Reflect <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> across <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/3/e33fe7d65facd8868f58b6e94ddc7f153a5a3f9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> to point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/4/3545551b3d62c4e23d5df7352a55602d0aa9adcd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P&#39;$\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />; since the ball travels in a straight path, it follows that the distance the ball traveled is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/9/e09be993ec778aceb629bea824d4fca16dce340d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AP&#39;$\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />. By <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Symmetry\" title=\"Symmetry\">symmetry</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/8/9c8cff95e827abfe57e64bd492deb989d9602c6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BP&#39; = 3, CP&#39; = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"141\" height=\"17\" />. By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Law_of_Cosines\" title=\"Law of Cosines\">Law of Cosines</a> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/d/bfd57f9ac7978949a55d3a90210928a20ca6154f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BCP&#39;$\" width=\"63\" height=\"14\" />,\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/2/c42681f493baec180aacebc08d9c3e0572293551.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^2 = 3^2 + 5^2 - 2 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 5 \\cos \\theta \\Longrightarrow \\theta = 120^{\\circ}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"322\" height=\"16\" /></center>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/d/a9dbda30bf586b90c8b335720778bbdf87be22e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BAC + \\angle BP&#39;C = 60 + 120 = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"284\" height=\"17\" />, it follows that <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quadrilateral\" title=\"Quadrilateral\">quadrilateral</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/0/c20e383f8ce613ba1bc54f1f8dd16bfdd43fb6b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABP&#39;C$\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" /> is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyclic_quadrilateral\" title=\"Cyclic quadrilateral\">cyclic quadrilateral</a>. By <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Ptolemy%27s_Theorem\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ptolemy&#39;s Theorem\">Ptolemy's Theorem</a>,\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/b/84b751660650f96c1173743f62d073a2e5a8ac3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\cdot 7 + 5\\cdot 7 = 7 \\cdot AP&#39; \\Longrightarrow \\boxed{AP&#39; = 8}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"287\" height=\"27\" /></center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_2_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_2\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 2\">2008 Mock ARML 2</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_2_Problems\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 2 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=206880\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_2_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 2 Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_2_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 2 Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_2_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 2 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_2_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 2 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_2_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 2 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_2_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 2 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_2_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 2 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_2_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 2 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_2_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 2 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017215701\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 152/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 987/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 70/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3623/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    9.574      1 Template:Mock_ARML_box\n100.00%    9.574      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:6960:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017215701 and revision id 26224. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}